.. attr:: provider[heat]
   :type: dict

   The attributes available for configuring a Heat provider.

   .. attr:: connection
      :type: str

      The name of the :ref:`connection <connections>` to use.

   .. attr:: resource-limits
      :type: dict

      Global resource limits across all stacks for this provider.

      .. attr:: max-stacks
         :type: int

         Maximum number of Heat stacks.

   .. attr:: resource-policy
      :type: dict

      Policy for allowed/disallowed Heat resource types in templates.

      .. attr:: allowed-resource-types
         :type: list

         Whitelist of allowed Heat resource types (e.g.,
         ``OS::Nova::Server``). If specified, templates may only use
         these types.

      .. attr:: disallowed-resource-types
         :type: list

         Blacklist of disallowed Heat resource types (e.g.,
         ``OS::Heat::ResourceGroup``). Templates using these types
         will be rejected.

   .. attr:: labels
      :type: list

      .. attr:: region
         :type: str

         OpenStack region name.

      .. attr:: availability-zone
         :type: str

         OpenStack availability zone.

      .. attr:: flavor
         :type: str
         :required:

         Flavor name for this label.

      .. attr:: image
         :type: str
         :required:

         Image name for this label.

   .. attr:: flavors
      :type: list

      .. attr:: name
         :type: str
         :required:

         Flavor name.

      .. attr:: max-instances
         :type: int

         Maximum instances per stack using this flavor.

      .. attr:: max-cores
         :type: int

         Maximum CPU cores per stack.

      .. attr:: max-ram
         :type: int

         Maximum RAM (MB) per stack.

      .. attr:: max-volumes
         :type: int

         Maximum volumes per stack.

      .. attr:: max-volume-gb
         :type: int

         Maximum volume storage (GB) per stack.

      .. attr:: max-networks
         :type: int

         Maximum networks per stack.

      .. attr:: max-routers
         :type: int

         Maximum routers per stack.

      .. attr:: max-routers-with-external-gw
         :type: int

         Maximum routers with external gateways per stack.

      .. attr:: max-floating-ips
         :type: int

         Maximum floating IPs per stack.

   .. attr:: images
      :type: list

      .. attr:: name
         :type: str
         :required:

         Image name used in label configuration.

      .. attr:: image-name
         :type: str
         :required:

         Glance image name or ID.
